  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/thumbCF.png?raw=true\" alt=\"缩略图\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"标题Logo\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UE85W5ynCg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" width=\"306\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252feldeston\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/eldeston?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&label=@eldeston&color=1DA1F2\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg?color=FF0000&logoWidth=16&label=Eldeston&logo=YouTube&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/534748?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=#FFFFFF&label=CurseForge下载量&color=#FF9101\" alt=\"CurseForge Downloads\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/LMIZZNxZ?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=#FFFFFF&label=Modrinth下载量&color=#00FF00\" alt=\"Modrinth Downloads\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>这是一款旨在重现已取消的<strong>超级超高清资源包（Super Duper Graphics Pack）</strong>风格以及其他热门《我的世界》作品风格的着色器包。由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Eldeston\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston</a>&nbsp;开发，并由&nbsp;<strong>FlameRender Studios</strong>&nbsp;呈现。</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>赞助商：BisectHosting</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFLAMERENDERSTUDIOS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/sponsor0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"BisectHosting 赞助商\"></a></p>\n<p>本着色器由&nbsp;<strong>BisectHosting</strong>&nbsp;赞助。点击上方的图片或使用代码&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFLAMERENDERSTUDIOS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FLAMERENDERSTUDIOS</strong></a>&nbsp;领取您的折扣，首月可享<strong>25%优惠</strong>！</p>\n<p>选择&nbsp;<strong>BisectHosting</strong>&nbsp;来托管各种游戏，其中包括我个人的一些最爱：<strong>Minecraft、Terraria 和 Project Zomboid</strong>！您首次购买金额的 <strong>65%</strong>&nbsp;将用于支持 Super Duper Vanilla 的开发！</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>视频</h2>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1gaI9rWunhA\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7pNVfX_ywkM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>截图</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/bd57c68a400e0722bc7132575ea7cec66ca529ab.png\" alt=\"截图 1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/1d38424b62d4461fae738019cbd1342145e9b4ac.png\" alt=\"截图 2\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/8edcb53225f8eeade023759c54df0916d9e3ff2a.png\" alt=\"截图 3\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/79de640c0254dd1f8ddf44052a79b57105a53f2c.png\" alt=\"截图 4\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/33a5e8c49e4a386c17a42ef48d96f240fa8e7d20.png\" alt=\"截图 5\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/f97e5cb26647bd487fae153b9942f87f373f7695.png\" alt=\"截图 6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/7735240a7238b15b28dba555abf0cd03f798823a.png\" alt=\"截图 7\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/f643695cdd4ab9f7c95750fb8ff43f396cd16f6c.png\" alt=\"截图 8\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/8e152465e03a3861acf4a7be6eca82a86cf26f1a.png\" alt=\"截图 9\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/0126040f5bcc1828e2de2b059799ab7ffb3d08ec.png\" alt=\"截图 10\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p>本着色器使用&nbsp;<strong>FlameRender (C) Studios 许可证</strong>。有关更多信息，请参阅&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252f127.0.0.1%253a3000%252fLICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a>。</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>版本兼容性</h2>\n<p>版本兼容性因两种已知的着色器加载器 Iris 和 Optifine 而异。来自 Minecraft 1.18.2+ 版本的 Iris 1.6.10+ 版本与此着色器兼容。对于 Optifine，情况因 GPU 厂商而异。请务必为您各自的 Minecraft 版本选择最新的 Iris 或 Optifine。</p>\n<p><strong>从本着色器的 1.3.7 版本开始，Optifine 的支持将不再优先处理或维护。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Iris</th>\n<th>Windows, Linux (Intel, AMD, NVidia)</th>\n<th>Apple (M1)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.18.2+</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.17.1-</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Optifine</th>\n<th>Windows, Linux (Intel, AMD, NVidia)</th>\n<th>Apple (M1)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.17.1+</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.14.2+</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.13.2-</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>官方 Modrinth 页面</h2>\n<p>Super Duper Vanilla 恰好也在 Modrinth 上！稳定版和最新版都将在那里提供。请查看&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fsuper-duper-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>&nbsp;并通过使用其中的任何下载链接来支持我！</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>社交链接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>加入我的 Discord 服务器，讨论我们工作室社区制作的其他开发内容！<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UE85W5ynCg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flamerender Studios Discord</a></li>\n<li>或者在 Twitter 上关注我或订阅我的 Youtube 频道，以获取我最近的开发动态和内容更新<br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/eldeston\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston 的 Twitter</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg?view_as=subscriber\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston 的频道</a></li>\n<li>您可以通过上述任何一种方式成为支持者，或通过 PayPal 捐赠<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%253fhosted_button_id%253d4XLQ4WE296JKW\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paypal 捐赠</a></li>\n</ul>",
